The program uses a `while` loop to continue until a player wins. Inside the loop, it prompts the players to select their options and checks if they have the same option. If they do, it prints a tie message and continues to the next iteration of the loop. If they do not have the same option, it prompts Player 1 to play again and breaks out of the loop if Player 1 chooses to play again. If Player 1 does not want to play again, it prints a message indicating that Player 2 has won.

